<title>DUBAI: SOCCER-ASIAN CUP GROUP B RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ASIAN CUP GROUP B RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Asian Cup group B matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia 6 Thailand 0 (halftime 4-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Khalid Al Temawi penalties 10, 29, Fahad Mahalel 15, 54, Khaled Al Mowalad 18, Sami Al Jaber 52.</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000.  </p>
<p> Iran   1   Iraq   2   (halftime 0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Iran - Ali Daei pen 90</p>
<p>Iraq - Husam Naji 37, Khalid Sabbar 71</p>
<p>Attendence: 15,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabulated - played, won, drawn, lost, goals for,</p>
<p>goals against, points):</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia     1    1    0    0    6    0     3</p>
<p> Iraq		 1    1    0    0    2    1     3</p>
<p> Iran		 1    0    0    1    1    2     0</p>
<p> Thailand	   1    0    0    1    0    6     0</p>
